## H2 — Quadratic typecheck / string-bind thrash
### Mechanisms (code)
1. **`char_at` = alloc + O(idx) UTF-8 scan** (`chs_rt_str.c` `oo_char_at` → `utf8_byte_index`).
   Loop `i in 0..n` with `char_at(src,i)` ⇒ **Θ(n²) time** + n short-lived strings (ARC frees → RSS can stay flat).
2. **`load_import` line/body build:** `line = line + c`, `body = body + line` — classic **string concat thrash** on expand.
3. **Double lex on check:** `run_check_core` → `lex_all(src)` then `tokenize_lines` → `lex_all` again + `collect_tokens`.
4. **`check_mod.run_check_module_body`:** `tokenize_lines` then `run_check_core` (third lex / second token list) if modular path used.
5. **String-encoded binds:** `binds = binds + name + "@" + depth + "\t"` (`tc_names.oo`); **`drop_depth`** rebuilds with per-char `entry = entry + char_at` (`tc_scope.oo`) — **O(|binds|²)** per RBRACE.
6. **~28 typecheck/check passes** over full `toks` (`check_drive.oo`); **46** `list_len(toks)` sites across `tc_*.oo` — multi full scans × `field_at` (linear scan of each token line).
7. **Import name `"\0"` bug:** emitted C compares to **`oo_str_lit("0")`** not NUL — rejects any import path containing digit **`0`** (`stage1_noarc.tmp.c` `reject_bad_import_name`). Blocks numbered synthetic trees; functional R2 residual, not pure heap.

### Source-size cost (import bypass, single large dep)
| Import body size (B) | check time | maxrss KB | notes |
|---------------------:|-----------:|----------:|-------|
| 2043 | 0.08 s | 7280 | OK |
| 8043 | 0.88 s | 10412 | OK |
| 20043 | 5.25 s | 16636 | OK |
| 70043 | ≥3 s timeout | ~7204 | hang; no 64KiB gate |

**Fit:** `time / n² ≈ 13–19×10⁻⁹` s/B² → **Θ(n²)** in expanded source length (lex/load dominated).
Extrapolate n=831740 (oodac expand): ~**(831740/20043)² × 5.25 ≈ 2.5×10³ s** order — matches observed multi-minute hang class.

### Module-count cost (tiny alpha modules, no digit `0`)
Chain `root → m_a → m_b → …` (payload ~70 B/module):

| N modules (excl. root) | expand bytes | time | maxrss KB | RSS/N |
|-----------------------:|-------------:|-----:|----------:|------:|
| 5 | 385 | 0.21 s | 10056 | ~2011 |
| 10 | 721 | 0.22 s | 15236 | ~1524 |
| 20 | 1401 | 0.32 s | 26664 | ~1333 |
| 40 | 2803 | 1.38 s | 56920 | ~1423 |
| 80 | 5643 | 7.72 s | **143320** | ~1792 |

- **RSS ~1.3–2 MB per module** for near-empty sources → token list + multi-pass TC tables dominate, not raw source.
- **Time superlinear in N** (40→80: ×2 modules, ×5.6 time).
- Tiny multi path A **works** (N≤80 OK under 60 s here); cost is **not** acceptable at oodac scale when combined with large source.

### Small product multi (control)
| Tree | Result | time | maxrss |
|------|--------|------|--------|
| `tmp_multi_import/main_import.oo` (3 files) | OK | 0.01 s | ~5824 KB |
| same ×10 sequential | OK | 0.25 s total | ~5832 KB |
| `test_bug/main.oo` | OK | 0.01 s | ~5592 KB |

**H2 residual:** rope/slice expand; byte-index lex; single lex pass; bind map not string; fewer TC passes / shared tables; incremental per-module check.

